"(see https://quay.io/repository/quarkus/ubi-quarkus-mandrel-builder-image?tab=tags[here (UBI 8)],\n"
"https://quay.io/repository/quarkus/ubi9-quarkus-mandrel-builder-image?tab=tags[here (UBI 9)],\n"
